  # Quadrant I Content (Top-Right: Global All-Rounders)
  - elementId: quad-1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [325, 136, 235, 140]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color: #2151FF; font-size: 9.5pt;">象限 Ⅰ：全栈一体化出海龙头</span></strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 3px; color: #041C2C; font-weight: bold; font-size: 8.5pt;">【投资评级：强烈推荐 / 战略底仓】</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 4px; color: #334155; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.35;">• 核心特征：具备海外可融资性资质、自研电芯/PCS、电网建模能力、全栈本地售后运维网络。</p>
        <p style="color: #334155; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.35;">• 代表企业：<strong>阳光电源、宁德时代、比亚迪、特斯拉</strong></p>

  # Quadrant II Content (Top-Left: Component Champions)
  - elementId: quad-2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [55, 125, 245, 150]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color: #041C2C; font-size: 9.5pt;">象限 Ⅱ：核心技术部件隐形冠军</span></strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 3px; color: #041C2C; font-weight: bold; font-size: 8pt;">【投资评级：积极增持 / 细分冠军】</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 4px; color: #475569; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.35;">• 核心特征：掌握专有电芯配方、大功率PCS算法或液冷温控，深度绑定下游海内外集成商。</p>
        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.35;">• 代表企业：<strong>海辰储能、盛弘股份、英维克、上能电气</strong></p>

  # Quadrant III Content (Bottom-Left: Low-end Assemblers)
  - elementId: quad-3-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [55, 312, 245, 160]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color: #E4536C; font-size: 9.5pt;">象限 Ⅲ：国内同质化纯组装代工</span></strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 3px; color: #E4536C; font-weight: bold; font-size: 8pt;">【投资评级：坚决规避 / 一票否决】</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 4px; color: #64748B; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.35;">• 核心特征：零核心技术外购组装，严重依赖国内低价内卷标段，毛利率&lt;8%，产能出清风险极高。</p>
        <p style="color: #64748B; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.35;">• 警示风险：应收账款账期长、违约连带赔偿与破产清算</p>

  # Quadrant IV Content (Bottom-Right: Brand Integrators)
  - elementId: quad-4-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [325, 312, 245, 160]
